From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:44:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] include: Windows.Web, and the rest of the web socket types in
 Windows.Networking.Sockets.

Windows.Web holds WebErrorStatus and WebError, the statics that read a
failed web request's HRESULT; WebSocketError is its twin in
Windows.Networking.Sockets.  The sockets namespace gains everything
MessageWebSocket reaches: IWebSocket, the control and information
objects with their second versions, IMessageWebSocket2 and 3, the event
arguments, WebSocketError, BandwidthStatistics, the server validation
request, and the collections and async types those name.  Every IID is
from the published metadata.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit e32fe519b1a6175aec5484544e0287b45c23f362)

